<title>USA: Associated Banc-Corp, Centra to merge.</title>
<headline>Associated Banc-Corp, Centra to merge.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Banc-Corp said Thursday it signed a definitive agreement to merge with $79 million asset  Centra Financial Inc in a stock-for-stock transaction.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction, contingent on regulatory and shareholder approval, is expected to be completed in the first quarter of 1997. Centra has offices in West Allis and Pewaukee, Wis.</p>
<p>Associated Banc-Corp specializes in providing financial services to individual and small- to mid-sized businesses.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
